# Written by the vendored check in vendor/README.md: the crate is its own workspace root, so
# `cargo check --manifest-path vendor/gpui-pre/Cargo.toml` leaves a lock beside it. Clear that
# file before `cargo xtask vendor --crate gpui-pre --check`, which compares every file.
/vendor/gpui-pre/Cargo.lock
# `cargo xtask vendor` builds the new tree in a staging directory inside vendor/ and swaps it
# into place; a crash between the two renames leaves the previous tree behind. Delete it.
/vendor/.gpui-vendor-*/
# The vendored crate's test modules include font files by relative path
# (vendor/gpui-pre/src/svg_renderer.rs:361-363 and the wasm-gated
# vendor/gpui-pre/examples/example_support/fonts.rs): ten files, all under this prefix. The
# repository carries no assets/ tree, so the whole prefix is ignored rather than the
# individual names the runbook's workflow creates.
/assets/fonts/
